    "tagLine": "12 Months Complimentary Broadband included!",
    "location": "Nestled in the heart of Blackrock, Alta Verde on Cross Avenue offers the perfect blend of coastal charm and urban convenience. Ideally situated in South Dublin, it provides seamless access to Dublin City Centre while placing you just minutes from the serenity of the sea and the beauty of the mountains.\n\nWith expansive outdoor spaces, beautifully landscaped surroundings, and a vibrant local community, Alta Verde delivers a lifestyle that harmoniously balances nature and connectivity. Excellent transport links — including direct access to the DART (with just a 12-minute journey to Grand Canal Dock) and major bus routes — ensure everything you need is within easy reach, whether it's a coastal stroll, a mountain hike, or a quick commute into the city.\n\nDiscover a location that offers the best of both worlds—where modern living meets natural beauty."
