  "description": "Apartment Facilities:\r\n•\tFully furnished apartments with a choice of premium interior finishes\r\n\r\n•\tContemporary fitted kitchens with solid surface countertops and integrated NEFF appliances, including oven, microwave, dishwasher\r\n\r\n•\tBespoke bathrooms and en-suites featuring rainfall showers; select units include baths\r\n\r\n•\tPrivate outdoor balconies for all apartments, with some offering multiple balconies or spacious terraces\r\n\r\n•\tIn-unit washing machine and separate dryer\r\n\r\n•\tIntegrated high-speed internet network for seamless Wi-Fi connectivity\r\n\r\nResidential Amenities: \r\n•\tIreland’s First Build-to-Rent Padel Court – Exclusively for Alta Verde residents\r\n\r\n•\tSecure Underground Parking and/or become a Member of the Car & Van Share Club with premium vehicles options exclusively for Alta Verde residents\r\n\r\n•\tThe Sky Gym & Fitness Suite – Train in a cutting-edge gym with panoramic views\r\n\r\n•\tPrivate Dining Room – Entertain guests with style on Level 8 of the Sylvan Block, complete with stunning views and a wraparound terrace\r\n\r\n•\tRooftop Terraces – Enjoy sweeping views from Dublin Bay to the city skyline, with designated BBQ and a yoga lawn \r\n\r\n•\tCinema & Games Room – A stylish space to relax, socialise, and unwind\r\n\r\n•\tCo-Working Hub – Includes meeting rooms and flexible breakout spaces\r\n\r\n•\tVast Landscaped Gardens – Tranquil green spaces with comfortable outdoor seating\r\n\r\n•\tPet-Friendly Living – Featuring a dedicated pet park and on-site pet wash facilities\r\n\r\n•\tProfessional Onsite Management Team – Ensuring seamless day-to-day living\r\n\r\n•\tSecure Underground Parking – With lift access to all buildings (additional cost)\r\n\r\n•\tSecure Bicycle Storage – Convenient and safe storage for residents’ bikes",
